	.string "SALANDIT$"
Coop_Text_FG_Where13:
	.string "FIERY PATH and the MAGMA HIDEOUT.\n"
	.string "A woman in LAVARIDGE gives a female.$"
Coop_Text_FG_Evo13:
	.string "Only a female evolves: level 33,\n"
	.string "SALAZZLE. Males never evolve.$"
