	.string "SIGILYPH$"
Coop_Text_FG_Where35:
	.string "The sealed chamber of the\n"
	.string "SANDBURIED RUINS. Its glyphs open it.$"
Coop_Text_FG_Evo35:
	.string "It does not evolve.$"
